---
interface Props {
  href?: string;
}

const { href = 'https://billy4select.substack.com/' } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="not-prose mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 p-6">
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text md:text-2xl">
    每週一封，繼續研究值得理解的新事物。
  </h2>
  <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
    把 AI、商業、投資與個人事業的新變化，拆成可以判斷、可以行動的線索。
  </p>
  <a
    href={href}
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-primary-dark"
  >
    訂閱電子報
    <svg
      class="h-4 w-4"
      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="2"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      <path d="M5 12h14" />
      <path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6" />
    </svg>
  </a>
</section>
